# Copy to /etc/seattlelink/env  (chmod 600, chown milescb -- a unit file is
# world-readable, which is why the keys live here instead of Environment= lines)

# Required. Puget Sound OneBusAway key from oba_api_key@soundtransit.org.
# Used server-side only (oba.py) -- never sent to a browser.
OBA_KEY=

# Optional. CARTO basemap key. Leave blank to use the keyless Esri dark-gray tiles
# (map.js falls back automatically). Unlike OBA_KEY this one IS handed to every
# visitor, because the tile URL is built client-side -- so if you set it, add a
# seattlelink.milescb.com referrer/domain allowlist in the CARTO dashboard.
CARTO_KEY=
